# ppt-master (platform-readonly-skills) offline pipeline dependencies.
# PyMuPDF stays on 1.x: ppt-master pdf_to_md.py imports the legacy `fitz` API.
# uharfbuzz stays <=0.56.x: the Runtime venv is CPython 3.11 and 0.56.4 ships
# cp310-abi3 wheels (0.57.0 failed to resolve in the image builder).
# SVG->PNG uses the pure-Python svglib fallback (cairosvg would need libcairo).
